      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22755/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs lightly in large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k9g7C8eBz9z73JDOum13EQcQNHI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22755-Libbys-Famous-Pumpkin-Pie-DDMFS-Step-03a-1338-b1f5dd0d006743adb3ff1d1e8d864db1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22755/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in pumpkin and sugar-spice mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E74dYWulCJJFC8NrNPeb3aIFftk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22755-Libbys-Famous-Pumpkin-Pie-DDMFS-Step-04a-1341-73d50d54210c4b10adf7def0a6b53bd1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22755/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually stir in evaporated milk. Pour into pie shell.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dTOWUFl0fEKQ4DV7G-HOnwYZ9q0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22755-Libbys-Famous-Pumpkin-Pie-DDMFS-Step-04b-1342-d0e7fb1b1b4c4128aee90b38f3bab3e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22755/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes. Reduce temperature to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) and continue to bake until a knife inserted near the center comes out clean, 40 to 50 more minutes. Remove from the oven and set on a wire rack to cool to room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve cooled pie immediately or refrigerate until ready to serve. (Do not freeze as this will cause the crust to separate from the filling.)",
